        <mxCell id="scope-note" value="Source: sitter-application.service.js. Each stage transition and final decision is a separate request. Saving/issuing/signing a real employment document is UC-21/EMP-02, not implicit in approval. SMTP runs after commit in MAIL-01. Real signatures/identity require real evidence; no automatic signing/password." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
